odot/issues/104463","id":2793962420,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6miHu0","user":{"login":"MarianoGnu","id":1776044,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NzYwNDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1776044?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu","html_url":"https://github.com/MarianoGnu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-10T14:45:07Z","updated_at":"2025-04-10T14:45:07Z","body":"One thing i would like to see before it's ready to be merged (because would break backwards compatibility) is besides having `Auto, Right, Left` is adding a fourth option: `Auto, Auto-Inverted, Right, Left`\r\nThat way, Auto-Inverted, in LTR languages would be located to the left, and in RTL languages located to the right\r\n\r\nOn the other hand, i would like to experiment if it is doable to convert this spinbox into a dropdown, or at least configure a min,max,step range","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2793962420/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2795049367","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104463#issuecomment-2795049367","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104463","id":2795049367,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6mmRGX","user":{"login":"pafuent","id":6979945,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5Nzk5NDU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6979945?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent","html_url":"https://github.com/pafuent","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-10T20:09:28Z","updated_at":"2025-04-10T20:09:28Z","body":"> One thing i would like to see before it's ready to be merged (because would break backwards compatibility) is besides having Auto, Right, Left is adding a fourth option: Auto, Auto-Inverted, Right, Left\r\nThat way, Auto-Inverted, in LTR languages would be located to the left, and in RTL languages located to the right\r\n\r\nI'm not convinced with the naming (auto-inverted is kind of weird), so I prefer to wait until I get some validation if this whole change makes sense and someone suggest a better name for it.\r\n\r\n>On the other hand, i would like to experiment if it is doable to convert this spinbox into a dropdown, or at least configure a min,max,step range\r\n\r\nI also though the same, but I think that should be a separate proposal and of course a separate PR","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions"